# Fisilink misc device configuration
#

config SWITCH_INTERFACE
	tristate "FiberHome switch register access support"
	depends on FISILINK
	help
	  This driver provides support for Xuanyuan1030M CPU to access
	  FiberHome switch registers through a misc device interface.

	  The driver provides register read/write operations, DMA buffer
	  management, and memory mapping support for userspace access.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called fh_pcie2pata.

	  If unsure, say Y.
